          "caption_html": "<p>Release Trailer of DOOMBLADE. It's available on PC on Steam, Epic Store and GOG.<br/>Check out the 60fps version here: <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/922050/DOOMBLADE/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/922050/DOOMBLADE/</a><br/><br/>Walkthrough of the game can be seen here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J8HB1I8Mdmw\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=J8HB1I8Mdmw</a><br/><br/>All in-game visuals and animations by me.<br/>I painted everything in Photoshop and modeled all the assets and characters in Blender. I animated everything in Unity.<br/>I also balanced the gameplay feel and economy in the game and worked on the level design.<br/>Code and lead game design by Kim Valori.<br/>Music and sfx by Brian Skeel.<br/>I acted as the Art Director for the release trailer from concept to final version while keeping the game Publisher's marketing team in the feedback loop.<br/>Video editing by Samuli Lautjärvi.<br/>Key Marketing Art in the end of the video by Boris Moncel from TAKEOFF Studios.</p>"
