      "title": "AAA Level Designer at Bugbear Entertainment",
      "description_html": "Worked as a Level Designer at Bugbear  Entertainment (2011 - 2013). Released Ridge Racer Unbounded (AAA-title) for PC and consoles.",
      "cover": {
        "type": "image",
